{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "mtpx-elasticsearch-collection",
    "name": "mtpx-elasticsearch",
    "description": "Collection para testar o exemplo Elasticsearch do Multpex Framework.\n\n## Autentica\u00e7\u00e3o\n\nUse o grupo **Auth (Keycloak)** para obter token e preencher `accessToken` automaticamente.\n\nTodos os endpoints de ES exigem Bearer token.\nDefina o valor da vari\u00e1vel `accessToken` no environment.\n\n## Fluxo\n\n1. Execute **Get Access Token** para autenticar\n2. Execute **Setup Index** para criar o \u00edndice `products`\n3. Use os endpoints CRUD e Search normalmente\n\n## Endpoints\n\n- **POST /es/admin/index/setup** \u2014 Criar \u00edndice products\n- **DELETE /es/admin/index** \u2014 Deletar \u00edndice products\n- **POST /es/products** \u2014 Indexar produto\n- **GET /es/products/:id** \u2014 Buscar produto por ID\n- **PUT /es/products/:id** \u2014 Atualizar produto\n- **DELETE /es/products/:id** \u2014 Deletar produto\n- **GET /es/products** \u2014 Search com filtros e pagina\u00e7\u00e3o\n- **POST /es/products/bulk** \u2014 Bulk indexing\n- **GET /es/products/count** \u2014 Contagem de documentos\n\n## Health\n\n- **GET /mtpx-elasticsearch/health** \u2014 Health check\n- **GET /mtpx-elasticsearch/ready** \u2014 Readiness check\n- **GET /mtpx-elasticsearch/live** \u2014 Liveness check",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://linkd.stg.k8s.multpex.com.br",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "keycloakUrl",
      "value": "https://keycloak.api.gmstg.multipex.com.br/auth",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "keycloakRealm",
      "value": "staging-multpex",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "keycloakClientId",
      "value": "web-client",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessTokenExpiresAt",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Refresh Token (Keycloak) \u2014 manual",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "refresh_token",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "refresh_token",
              "value": "{{refreshToken}}",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{keycloakRealm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
          "host": [
            "{{keycloakUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "realms",
            "{{keycloakRealm}}",
            "protocol",
            "openid-connect",
            "token"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Manual refresh \u2014 normally the collection pre-request script handles this automatically."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "if (data.access_token) {",
              "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', data.access_token);",
              "  pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiresAt', String(Math.floor(Date.now()/1000) + (data.expires_in || 300)));",
              "  if (data.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refresh_token);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
